  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Pacific Deck Workbench",
    "overview": "A compact local deck workbench, following the user-confirmed Moxfield-inspired working density. Pacific navy surrounds blue-slate panels; coral identifies primary actions and apricot marks focus and analysis. Full card imagery anchors the deck library and commander area.\n\nThe interface uses one system sans, aligned rows, short labels and native controls. Deck editing, saved-revision findings and comparison stay close to the task. Supporting rules, provenance and optional AI details use progressive disclosure.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Dark Pacific navy with restrained coral and apricot accents.",
      "Dense aligned rows and desktop working columns that stack on mobile.",
      "Real card imagery, short copy and visible keyboard focus."
    ],
